note The document toolbar's 'hide all code' hides the code of every step of the path being read, leaving headers and notes; 'show all' shows every step's code again and also unfolds every folded step. The reader reaches for it to read a path's notes and structure as prose without the code filling the screen. Steps shown inline under links keep their own state.

